(
    title: "Dune",
    developer: Some("Bruce Poehlman, Gary Stark"),
    description: Some("A very early demo of the 1984 film tie-in, abandoned when Jack Tramiel\'s takeover ended 2600 development: Paul Atreides — a square, in the Adventure mould — collects tools against Baron Harkonnen to free Arrakis. The room-structure code was never written, so the surviving build wanders a multicoloured test maze instead of a desert."),
